     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>Joining Gototherapy means telling us who you are, what role you hold, and where we can check it: your professional register entry, your insurance, your supervision and your identity. A person does the checking and rechecks every year. Nobody pays before acceptance, and nothing you enter is stored in your browser.</p>",
