   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "94c9bce",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<!-- Functional block, kept verbatim. Replace with [gototherapy_join_form] when the plugin is installed. -->\n<div data-page=\"join\">\n<div class=\"container join-shell\">\n<div class=\"join-main\">\n<ol aria-label=\"Application progress\" class=\"progress\">\n<li aria-current=\"step\" class=\"progress__item is-current\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"progress__bar\"></span><span class=\"progress__label\">1. About you</span></li>\n<li class=\"progress__item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"progress__bar\"></span><span class=\"progress__label\">2. Your role</span></li>\n<li class=\"progress__item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"progress__bar\"></span><span class=\"progress__label\">3. Verification</span></li>\n<li class=\"progress__item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"progress__bar\"></span><span class=\"progress__label\">4. Practice</span></li>\n<li class=\"progress__item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"progress__bar\"></span><span class=\"progress__label\">5. Profile</span></li>\n<li class=\"progress__item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"progress__bar\"></span><span class=\"progress__label\">6. Review</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"visually-hidden\" data-step-status=\"\"></p>\n<form action=\"/thank-you/\" data-join-form=\"\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\" novalidate=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-summary\" role=\"alert\"></div>\n<p class=\"required-note\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span><span class=\"visually-hidden\">asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n<!-- Step 1 -->\n<section aria-labelledby=\"s1\" class=\"step-panel is-active\" data-step-title=\"About you\">\n<div class=\"form-section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2 form-section__title\" id=\"s1\">About you</h2>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">The name here is the one on your register entry. You can show a different name on your profile later.</p>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"first-name\">First name<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"given-name\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"first-name\" name=\"firstName\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"last-name\">Last name<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"family-name\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"last-name\" name=\"lastName\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"email\">Email<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"email-hint\">We send the confirmation and the outcome of your checks here.</p><input aria-describedby=\"email-hint\" autocomplete=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" data-describedby=\"email-hint\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"phone\">Phone</label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"phone-hint\">Only used if we need to check something about your application.</p><input aria-describedby=\"phone-hint\" autocomplete=\"tel\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"password\">Choose a password<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"pw-hint\">At least 12 characters.</p><div class=\"input-with-button\"><input aria-describedby=\"pw-hint\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"form-control\" data-describedby=\"pw-hint\" id=\"password\" minlength=\"12\" name=\"password\" required=\"\" type=\"password\"/><button aria-label=\"Show password\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"input-with-button__button\" data-password-toggle=\"password\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></button></div><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"password2\">Repeat password<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"form-control\" data-match=\"password\" id=\"password2\" name=\"password2\" required=\"\" type=\"password\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions form-actions--between\"><span></span><button class=\"button button--primary\" data-next=\"\" type=\"button\">Continue to your role</button></div>\n</section>\n<!-- Step 2 -->\n<section aria-labelledby=\"s2\" class=\"step-panel\" data-step-title=\"Your role\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2 form-section__title\" id=\"s2\">Your professional role</h2>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">Choose every role you hold. Holding two roles means meeting both standards: a therapist who is also a coach still has their register checked.</p>\n<fieldset class=\"form-fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"form-fieldset__legend\">Roles<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></legend>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input data-error-required=\"Choose at least one role.\" name=\"roles\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"therapist\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\"><strong>Therapist</strong> (counsellor or psychotherapist). Register, expiry, insurance, supervision and identity are checked.</span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input name=\"roles\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"supervisor\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\"><strong>Supervisor.</strong> Register, expiry, insurance, identity and supervision training are checked.</span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input name=\"roles\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"coach\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\"><strong>Coach or wellbeing practitioner.</strong> Insurance and identity are checked.</span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input name=\"roles\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"trainer\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\"><strong>Trainer.</strong> Register, expiry, insurance and identity are checked.</span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input name=\"roles\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"training-provider\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\"><strong>Training provider</strong> (organisation). Course accreditation, insurance and identity are checked.</span></label>\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p>\n</fieldset>\n<div class=\"note-panel\" data-unregulated-note=\"\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"note-panel__title\">Printed on your profile</p><p>Coaching and training provision are not regulated professions in the UK. Your profile will say: “This is not a regulated profession in the UK, so there is no register to check.” It is styled as a fact, not a warning.</p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"job-title\">Professional title as you would like it shown<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"title-hint\">For example “Counsellor” or “Psychotherapist and supervisor”. Please do not add qualifications we cannot check.</p><input aria-describedby=\"title-hint\" class=\"form-control\" data-describedby=\"title-hint\" id=\"job-title\" name=\"title\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions form-actions--between\"><button class=\"button button--ghost\" data-back=\"\" type=\"button\">Back</button><button class=\"button button--primary\" data-next=\"\" type=\"button\">Continue to verification</button></div>\n</section>\n<!-- Step 3 -->\n<section aria-labelledby=\"s3\" class=\"step-panel\" data-step-title=\"Verification\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2 form-section__title\" id=\"s3\">Where we can check you</h2>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">A person checks each of these. Documents are uploaded to private storage, never to your browser. This prototype does not upload anything.</p>\n<div data-role-block=\"therapist supervisor trainer\">\n<h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\">Professional register</h3>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"reg-body\">Registering body<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><select class=\"form-control form-control--select\" id=\"reg-body\" name=\"registerBody\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Choose</option><option>BACP</option><option>UKCP</option><option>BPS</option><option>HCPC</option><option>NCPS</option><option>COSCA</option><option>BABCP</option><option>Other (tell us below)</option></select><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"reg-number\">Registration number<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"off\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"reg-number\" name=\"registerNumber\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"reg-expiry\">Registration expiry or renewal date<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"reg-expiry\" name=\"registerExpiry\" required=\"\" type=\"date\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"reg-other\">If “Other”, which register</label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"reg-other\" name=\"registerOther\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-role-block=\"training-provider\">\n<h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\">Course accreditation</h3>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"acc-body\">Awarding or accrediting body<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"acc-body\" name=\"accreditationBody\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"acc-ref\">Accreditation reference<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"acc-ref\" name=\"accreditationRef\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem\">Insurance</h3>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"ins-provider\">Insurer<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"ins-provider\" name=\"insurer\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"ins-expiry\">Policy expiry date<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"ins-expiry\" name=\"insuranceExpiry\" required=\"\" type=\"date\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"ins-doc\">Insurance certificate (PDF or image)<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input accept=\".pdf,image/*\" class=\"form-control form-control--file\" id=\"ins-doc\" name=\"insuranceDocument\" required=\"\" type=\"file\"/><p class=\"form-field__hint\" data-file-name=\"\"></p><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n<div data-role-block=\"therapist\">\n<h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem\">Supervision</h3>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">We contact your supervisor to confirm the arrangement. They are not asked anything about your clients.</p>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"sup-name\">Supervisor’s name<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"sup-name\" name=\"supervisorName\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"sup-email\">Supervisor’s email<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"sup-email\" name=\"supervisorEmail\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"sup-freq\">How often you have supervision<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><select class=\"form-control form-control--select\" id=\"sup-freq\" name=\"supervisionFrequency\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Choose</option><option>Weekly</option><option>Fortnightly</option><option>Monthly</option><option>Other</option></select><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-role-block=\"supervisor\">\n<h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem\">Supervision training</h3>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"sup-training\">Supervision qualification<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input class=\"form-control\" id=\"sup-training\" name=\"supervisionTraining\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"sup-training-doc\">Certificate (PDF or image)<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input accept=\".pdf,image/*\" class=\"form-control form-control--file\" id=\"sup-training-doc\" name=\"supervisionTrainingDocument\" required=\"\" type=\"file\"/><p class=\"form-field__hint\" data-file-name=\"\"></p><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem\">Identity</h3>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">We match the person applying to the person on the register. A passport or driving licence is enough. We do not keep the image after the check.</p>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"id-type\">Document type<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><select class=\"form-control form-control--select\" id=\"id-type\" name=\"identityType\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Choose</option><option>Passport</option><option>Driving licence</option><option>Other photo ID</option></select><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"id-doc\">Photo ID (image or PDF)<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input accept=\".pdf,image/*\" class=\"form-control form-control--file\" id=\"id-doc\" name=\"identityDocument\" required=\"\" type=\"file\"/><p class=\"form-field__hint\" data-file-name=\"\"></p><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions form-actions--between\"><button class=\"button button--ghost\" data-back=\"\" type=\"button\">Back</button><button class=\"button button--primary\" data-next=\"\" type=\"button\">Continue to your practice</button></div>\n</section>\n<!-- Step 4 -->\n<section aria-labelledby=\"s4\" class=\"step-panel\" data-step-title=\"Practice\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2 form-section__title\" id=\"s4\">Your practice</h2>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">Where and how you work. Fees and availability can be changed in your account at any time; counts and ranges on the site are computed from what members enter, never typed.</p>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"town\">Town or city<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"address-level2\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"town\" name=\"town\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"postcode\">Postcode of your practice<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"pc-hint\">Used to place you on town pages. Never shown in full.</p><input aria-describedby=\"pc-hint\" autocomplete=\"postal-code\" class=\"form-control\" data-describedby=\"pc-hint\" id=\"postcode\" name=\"postcode\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n</div>\n<fieldset class=\"form-fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"form-fieldset__legend\">Session format<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></legend>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input data-error-required=\"Choose at least one format.\" name=\"format\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"in-person\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">In person</span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input name=\"format\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"online\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">Online (video or phone)</span></label>\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p>\n</fieldset>\n<div class=\"form-group form-group--2\">\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"fee\">Fee per session (GBP)</label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"fee-hint\">Optional now. If left blank your profile says fees are available on request.</p><input aria-describedby=\"fee-hint\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"fee\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" name=\"fee\" step=\"1\" type=\"number\"/><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"duration\">Session length</label><select class=\"form-control form-control--select\" id=\"duration\" name=\"duration\"><option>50 minutes</option><option>60 minutes</option><option>90 minutes</option><option>Other</option></select></div>\n</div>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input name=\"concessions\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">I offer some concessionary or reduced-fee places</span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input checked=\"\" name=\"accepting\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">I am currently taking new clients</span></label>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"availability\">Typical availability</label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"av-hint\">A sentence is fine. You set exact weekly hours in your account after acceptance.</p><textarea aria-describedby=\"av-hint\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"availability\" name=\"availabilityNote\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions form-actions--between\"><button class=\"button button--ghost\" data-back=\"\" type=\"button\">Back</button><button class=\"button button--primary\" data-next=\"\" type=\"button\">Continue to your profile</button></div>\n</section>\n<!-- Step 5 -->\n<section aria-labelledby=\"s5\" class=\"step-panel\" data-step-title=\"Profile\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2 form-section__title\" id=\"s5\">Your profile, in your words</h2>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">Write as though you are answering somebody who has been putting off this email for months. Four questions, 40 to 80 words each, plain English, first person. Please do not list modalities without explaining them, and do not promise outcomes. We will not publish claims about results.</p>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"p1\">Who do you work with, and what do they usually come to you about?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><textarea class=\"form-control\" data-error=\"Please write at least a few sentences (around 40 words).\" id=\"p1\" minlength=\"120\" name=\"worksWith\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\"></textarea><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"p2\">What is a session with you actually like?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><textarea class=\"form-control\" data-error=\"Please write at least a few sentences (around 40 words).\" id=\"p2\" minlength=\"120\" name=\"sessions\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\"></textarea><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"p3\">What drew you to this work?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><textarea class=\"form-control\" data-error=\"Please write at least a few sentences (around 40 words).\" id=\"p3\" minlength=\"120\" name=\"drawnTo\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\"></textarea><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"p4\">What should somebody know before they contact you?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></label><textarea class=\"form-control\" data-error=\"Please write at least a few sentences (around 40 words).\" id=\"p4\" minlength=\"120\" name=\"beforeContact\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\"></textarea><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-field__label\" for=\"photo\">Profile photograph</label><p class=\"form-field__hint\" id=\"photo-hint\">Optional now, but a profile is only indexed by search engines once it has a real photograph of you. Never a stock image. Until then, your initials are shown.</p><input accept=\"image/*\" aria-describedby=\"photo-hint\" class=\"form-control form-control--file\" id=\"photo\" name=\"photo\" type=\"file\"/><p class=\"form-field__hint\" data-file-name=\"\"></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions form-actions--between\"><button class=\"button button--ghost\" data-back=\"\" type=\"button\">Back</button><button class=\"button button--primary\" data-next=\"\" type=\"button\">Review your application</button></div>\n</section>\n<!-- Step 6 -->\n<section aria-labelledby=\"s6\" class=\"step-panel\" data-step-title=\"Review and submit\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"form-section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2 form-section__title\" id=\"s6\">Check it, then send it</h2>\n<p class=\"form-section__desc\">Anything marked missing will stop the application. Use Edit to go back; nothing you entered is lost.</p>\n<div data-review=\"\"></div>\n<h3 class=\"h3\">Consent and terms</h3>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input data-error-required=\"We cannot check your registration without this.\" name=\"consentChecks\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">I consent to Gototherapy checking my professional register entry, contacting my insurer’s certificate details and my supervisor to confirm the arrangement, and repeating these checks annually.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></span></label>\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"form-field__error\" style=\"margin-left:2.2rem\"></p>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input data-error-required=\"Identity checking is required for listing.\" name=\"consentIdentity\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">I consent to my identity document being viewed for the purpose of matching me to my register entry, and understand the image is deleted after the check.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input data-error-required=\"You need to accept the terms to apply.\" name=\"acceptTerms\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">I have read the <a href=\"/terms/\">terms of service</a>, the <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy policy</a> and the <a href=\"/cancellation-and-refunds/\">cancellation and refunds policy</a>.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"form-check\"><input data-error-required=\"Please confirm the information is accurate.\" name=\"accurate\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"form-check__label\">The information I have given is accurate, and I will tell Gototherapy if my registration, insurance or supervision changes.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"req\">*</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"note-panel\"><p class=\"note-panel__title\">Nothing is paid now</p><p>Membership is only set up after acceptance. You will receive an email when your checks are complete. <a href=\"/pricing/\">What membership includes</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions form-actions--between\"><button class=\"button button--ghost\" data-back=\"\" type=\"button\">Back</button><button class=\"button button--primary\" type=\"submit\">Send application</button></div>\n<p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Backend required: this form posts to <code>POST /api/applications</code>. In the prototype nothing is sent or stored.</p>\n</section>\n</form>\n</div>\n<aside aria-label=\"What to have ready\" class=\"join-aside\">\n<div class=\"note-panel\">\n<p class=\"note-panel__title\">Have these to hand</p>\n<ul class=\"join-aside__list\">\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Your registration number and renewal date</span></li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Your insurance certificate</span></li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Your supervisor’s name and email</span></li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Photo ID</span></li>\n<li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>About 20 minutes</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n<p class=\"dashboard-card__label\">What happens next</p>\n<p class=\"card__text\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">A person checks each item, contacts your supervisor, and emails you the outcome. Your profile is published only when every check for your role is complete.</p>\n<p class=\"card__text\" style=\"margin-top:.75rem\"><a href=\"/how-we-verify/\">How we verify</a> · <a href=\"/pricing/\">Pricing</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n<p class=\"dashboard-card__label\">Already a member?</p>\n<p class=\"card__text\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem\"><a href=\"/login/\">Log in to your account</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n</div>"
